{"id":"mtk-e-eksponen-logaritma","title":"Eksponen & Logaritma","subject":"matematika","mapel":"Matematika","fase":["E"],"kelas":[10],"elemen":["Bilangan"],"description":"20 soal sifat eksponen, persamaan eksponen, dan logaritma, dengan langkah penyelesaian.","source":{"kind":"materi","note":"Rumah Pelajar, latihan Eksponen & Logaritma"},"topic":"Eksponen dan logaritma, sifat-sifat dan persamaan (Fase E)","items":[{"id":"el-1","stem":"Jika \\(\\left(\\dfrac{1}{m^2}\\right)^4=m^p\\), maka nilai \\(p\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(-8\\)","\\(-6\\)","\\(2\\)","\\(6\\)","\\(8\\)"],"answer":0,"label":"Eksponen · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["\\(\\dfrac{1}{m^2}=m^{-2}\\)","\\((m^{-2})^4=m^{-8}\\)","\\(m^{-8}=m^p \\Rightarrow p=-8\\)"],"answerText":"\\(p=-8\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-2","stem":"Bentuk sederhana dari \\(\\dfrac{100\\,p^{-4}q^{2}}{10\\,p^{6}q^{-3}}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(10\\,p^{2}q^{-1}\\)","\\(10\\,p^{-10}q^{5}\\)","\\(90\\,p^{-10}q^{5}\\)","\\(10\\,p^{10}q^{-5}\\)","\\(10\\,p^{-24}q^{-6}\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Eksponen · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["Bagi koefisien: \\(100:10=10\\)","Pangkat \\(p\\): \\(p^{-4-6}=p^{-10}\\)","Pangkat \\(q\\): \\(q^{2-(-3)}=q^{5}\\)"],"answerText":"\\(10\\,p^{-10}q^{5}\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-3","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\(5^{x-9}=25^{3-x}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(3\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(5\\)","\\(6\\)","\\(9\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Eksponen · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["\\(25^{3-x}=(5^2)^{3-x}=5^{6-2x}\\)","Basis sama: \\(x-9=6-2x\\)","\\(3x=15 \\Rightarrow x=5\\)"],"answerText":"\\(x=5\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-4","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\(4^{3x-1}=\\dfrac{1}{8^{x-1}}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac13\\)","\\(\\tfrac49\\)","\\(\\tfrac59\\)","\\(\\tfrac23\\)","\\(1\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Eksponen · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["Ubah ke basis 2: \\(4^{3x-1}=2^{6x-2}\\)","\\(\\dfrac{1}{8^{x-1}}=2^{-3(x-1)}=2^{-3x+3}\\)","\\(6x-2=-3x+3 \\Rightarrow 9x=5\\)","\\(x=\\tfrac59\\)"],"answerText":"\\(x=\\tfrac59\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-5","stem":"Bentuk sederhana dari \\(2\\sqrt{20}+3\\sqrt{45}-\\sqrt{80}+\\sqrt{125}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(10\\sqrt5\\)","\\(12\\sqrt5\\)","\\(14\\sqrt5\\)","\\(16\\sqrt5\\)","\\(22\\sqrt5\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Eksponen · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["\\(2\\sqrt{20}=2\\cdot2\\sqrt5=4\\sqrt5\\)","\\(3\\sqrt{45}=3\\cdot3\\sqrt5=9\\sqrt5\\)","\\(\\sqrt{80}=4\\sqrt5\\), \\(\\sqrt{125}=5\\sqrt5\\)","\\(4\\sqrt5+9\\sqrt5-4\\sqrt5+5\\sqrt5=14\\sqrt5\\)"],"answerText":"\\(14\\sqrt5\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-6","stem":"Bentuk rasional dari \\(\\dfrac{5}{2\\sqrt3+\\sqrt7}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(2\\sqrt3+\\sqrt7\\)","\\(2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7\\)","\\(\\sqrt7-2\\sqrt3\\)","\\(5(2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7)\\)","\\(\\tfrac{2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7}{5}\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Eksponen · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["Kalikan dengan sekawan \\(\\dfrac{2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7}{2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7}\\)","Penyebut: \\((2\\sqrt3)^2-(\\sqrt7)^2=12-7=5\\)","\\(\\dfrac{5(2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7)}{5}=2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7\\)"],"answerText":"\\(2\\sqrt3-\\sqrt7\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-7","stem":"Bentuk sederhana dari \\(\\left(\\dfrac{5m^{-3}n^{2}}{m^{2}n^{-4}}\\right)^{2}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(25\\,m^{-10}n^{12}\\)","\\(10\\,m^{-10}n^{12}\\)","\\(25\\,m^{-2}n^{-4}\\)","\\(25\\,m^{10}n^{-12}\\)","\\(5\\,m^{-5}n^{6}\\)"],"answer":0,"label":"Eksponen · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["Di dalam kurung: \\(m^{-3-2}=m^{-5}\\), \\(n^{2-(-4)}=n^{6}\\)","Jadi \\((5m^{-5}n^{6})^2\\)","\\(=25\\,m^{-10}n^{12}\\)"],"answerText":"\\(25\\,m^{-10}n^{12}\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-8","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\(4^{x+3}=\\sqrt[3]{8^{x+3}}\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(-6\\)","\\(-3\\)","\\(0\\)","\\(3\\)","\\(6\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Eksponen · Sulit","level":"sulit","steps":["\\(4^{x+3}=2^{2x+6}\\)","\\(\\sqrt[3]{8^{x+3}}=(2^{3(x+3)})^{1/3}=2^{x+3}\\)","\\(2x+6=x+3 \\Rightarrow x=-3\\)"],"answerText":"\\(x=-3\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-9","stem":"Diketahui \\(f(x)=2^{x+1}-3\\). Nilai \\(f(3)\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(5\\)","\\(13\\)","\\(16\\)","\\(19\\)","\\(29\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Eksponen · Sulit (fungsi)","level":"sulit","steps":["\\(f(3)=2^{3+1}-3\\)","\\(=2^4-3=16-3\\)","\\(=13\\)"],"answerText":"\\(13\\)","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-10","stem":"Massa \\(y\\) gram zat radioaktif setelah \\(t\\) tahun dirumuskan \\(y=10\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^{t/25}\\). Massa zat setelah 50 tahun adalah ....","options":["\\(10\\) gram","\\(5\\) gram","\\(2{,}5\\) gram","\\(1{,}25\\) gram","\\(0{,}5\\) gram"],"answer":2,"label":"Eksponen · Sulit (aplikasi)","level":"sulit","steps":["Substitusi \\(t=50\\): \\(y=10\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^{50/25}\\)","\\(=10\\left(\\tfrac12\\right)^{2}=10\\cdot\\tfrac14\\)","\\(=2{,}5\\) gram (massa awal saat \\(t=0\\) adalah 10 gram)"],"answerText":"\\(2{,}5\\) gram","concept":"matematika:eksponen","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-11","stem":"Nilai dari \\({}^{2}\\!\\log 32+{}^{3}\\!\\log \\tfrac19\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(3\\)","\\(5\\)","\\(7\\)","\\(-3\\)","\\(\\tfrac52\\)"],"answer":0,"label":"Logaritma · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["\\({}^{2}\\!\\log 32=5\\) karena \\(2^5=32\\)","\\({}^{3}\\!\\log \\tfrac19=-2\\) karena \\(3^{-2}=\\tfrac19\\)","\\(5+(-2)=3\\)"],"answerText":"\\(3\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-12","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) jika \\({}^{2}\\!\\log x=5\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(10\\)","\\(25\\)","\\(32\\)","\\(64\\)","\\(7\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["Ubah ke bentuk pangkat: \\({}^{2}\\!\\log x=5 \\Leftrightarrow x=2^5\\)","\\(x=32\\)"],"answerText":"\\(x=32\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-13","stem":"Nilai dari \\({}^{4}\\!\\log 8\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac23\\)","\\(\\tfrac32\\)","\\(2\\)","\\(\\tfrac12\\)","\\(3\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Logaritma · Mudah","level":"mudah","steps":["Ganti basis 2: \\({}^{4}\\!\\log 8=\\dfrac{{}^{2}\\!\\log 8}{{}^{2}\\!\\log 4}\\)","\\(=\\dfrac{3}{2}\\)"],"answerText":"\\(\\tfrac32\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-14","stem":"Hasil dari \\({}^{6}\\!\\log 12\\sqrt2+{}^{6}\\!\\log \\sqrt3+{}^{6}\\!\\log 18-{}^{6}\\!\\log 2-{}^{6}\\!\\log 3\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(2\\)","\\(\\tfrac52\\)","\\(3\\)","\\(\\tfrac72\\)","\\(6\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Logaritma · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["Gabungkan: \\({}^{6}\\!\\log \\dfrac{12\\sqrt2\\cdot\\sqrt3\\cdot18}{2\\cdot3}\\)","Numerus: \\(\\dfrac{216\\sqrt6}{6}=36\\sqrt6=6^2\\cdot6^{1/2}=6^{5/2}\\)","\\({}^{6}\\!\\log 6^{5/2}=\\tfrac52\\)"],"answerText":"\\(\\tfrac52\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-15","stem":"Diketahui \\({}^{2}\\!\\log 3=p\\). Nilai \\({}^{2}\\!\\log 12\\) dalam \\(p\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(4p\\)","\\(2p\\)","\\(p+2\\)","\\(p+4\\)","\\(2p+1\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["\\(12=4\\cdot3\\)","\\({}^{2}\\!\\log 12={}^{2}\\!\\log 4+{}^{2}\\!\\log 3\\)","\\(=2+p\\)"],"answerText":"\\(p+2\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-16","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\({}^{2}\\!\\log x+{}^{2}\\!\\log (x-2)=3\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(-2\\)","\\(2\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(-2\\) dan \\(4\\)","\\(8\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["\\({}^{2}\\!\\log x(x-2)=3 \\Rightarrow x^2-2x=8\\)","\\(x^2-2x-8=0 \\Rightarrow (x-4)(x+2)=0\\)","\\(x=4\\) atau \\(x=-2\\)","Syarat numerus: \\(x>0\\) dan \\(x-2>0\\), jadi \\(x>2\\). \\(x=-2\\) tidak memenuhi"],"answerText":"\\(x=4\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-17","stem":"Nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\({}^{5}\\!\\log (x+4)-{}^{5}\\!\\log (x-2)=1\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(\\tfrac32\\)","\\(3\\)","\\(\\tfrac72\\)","\\(\\tfrac{14}{3}\\)","\\(6\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Sedang","level":"sedang","steps":["\\({}^{5}\\!\\log \\dfrac{x+4}{x-2}=1 \\Rightarrow \\dfrac{x+4}{x-2}=5\\)","\\(x+4=5x-10 \\Rightarrow 4x=14\\)","\\(x=\\tfrac72\\); cek syarat: \\(x-2=\\tfrac32>0\\) ✓"],"answerText":"\\(x=\\tfrac72\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-18","stem":"Diketahui \\(x={}^{3}\\!\\log \\tfrac{1}{125}\\cdot{}^{8}\\!\\log 9\\cdot{}^{5}\\!\\log 64\\). Nilai \\(x\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(-18\\)","\\(-12\\)","\\(-6\\)","\\(6\\)","\\(12\\)"],"answer":1,"label":"Logaritma · Sulit","level":"sulit","steps":["\\({}^{3}\\!\\log \\tfrac1{125}={}^{3}\\!\\log 5^{-3}=-3\\,{}^{3}\\!\\log 5\\)","\\({}^{8}\\!\\log 9={}^{2^3}\\!\\log 3^2=\\tfrac23\\,{}^{2}\\!\\log 3\\)","\\({}^{5}\\!\\log 64=6\\,{}^{5}\\!\\log 2\\)","\\(x=(-3)\\cdot\\tfrac23\\cdot6\\cdot({}^{3}\\!\\log 5\\cdot{}^{5}\\!\\log 2\\cdot{}^{2}\\!\\log 3)=-12\\cdot{}^{3}\\!\\log 3\\)","\\(x=-12\\cdot1=-12\\)"],"answerText":"\\(-12\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-19","stem":"Jumlah semua nilai \\(x\\) yang memenuhi \\(({}^{2}\\!\\log x)^2-3\\,{}^{2}\\!\\log x+2=0\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(3\\)","\\(4\\)","\\(6\\)","\\(8\\)","\\(2\\)"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Sulit","level":"sulit","steps":["Misalkan \\(y={}^{2}\\!\\log x\\): \\(y^2-3y+2=0\\)","\\((y-1)(y-2)=0 \\Rightarrow y=1\\) atau \\(y=2\\)","\\(y=1 \\Rightarrow x=2\\); \\(y=2 \\Rightarrow x=4\\)","Jumlah: \\(2+4=6\\)"],"answerText":"\\(6\\)","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"},{"id":"el-20","stem":"Tingkat kebisingan dirumuskan \\(L=10\\,{}^{10}\\!\\log \\dfrac{I}{I_0}\\) desibel. Jika intensitas suara \\(I=1000\\,I_0\\), maka \\(L\\) adalah ....","options":["\\(3\\) dB","\\(10\\) dB","\\(30\\) dB","\\(100\\) dB","\\(1000\\) dB"],"answer":2,"label":"Logaritma · Sulit (aplikasi)","level":"sulit","steps":["\\(L=10\\,{}^{10}\\!\\log 1000\\)","\\({}^{10}\\!\\log 1000=3\\) karena \\(10^3=1000\\)","\\(L=10\\cdot3=30\\) dB"],"answerText":"\\(30\\) dB","concept":"matematika:logaritma","elemen":"Bilangan"}]}